        <mxCell id="emoweZ40clOwNqNBo7m6-4" edge="1" parent="1" source="emoweZ40clOwNqNBo7m6-2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="WD0gpCrcXnB96PVzJMwT-7">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="emoweZ40clOwNqNBo7m6-2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="136.5" width="166.15" x="940.0000000000001" y="891.75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Kj6kitlnbV3NeVCk_-4H-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Ticket Booking System&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Functional Requirements&lt;br&gt;1. Search -&amp;gt; User must be able to search events using filters such as event title, location or specific date of show&lt;br&gt;2. Event Details -&amp;gt; User must be able to view details of specific event : No of seats, description and meta data&lt;br&gt;3. Booking and Payment -&amp;gt; User must be allow user to select a seat and complete transaction to book a ticket&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Non Functional Requirement&lt;br&gt;1. Scale -&amp;gt; 100M DAU&lt;br&gt;2. High Availabilty -&amp;gt; Search or viewing an event&lt;br&gt;3. High Consistency -&amp;gt; Booking tickets&lt;br&gt;4. Low Latency&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;API Design&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. POST : /api/auth/login&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;2. GET : /api/events -&amp;gt; search based on query of location or title or date&lt;br&gt;3. GET : /api/events/{eventId} -&amp;gt; Full event details&lt;br&gt;4. GET : /api/events/{eventId}/seats -&amp;gt; Live seat&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;5. POST :/api/{eventId}/seats/lock -&amp;gt; lock the seat for some TTL&lt;br&gt;6. POST : /api/{eventId}/booking -&amp;gt; Payment and get booking Id&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Entities&lt;br&gt;1. Users (id, name, email, password)&lt;br&gt;2. Events (id, title, location, date, totalseats, available seats)&lt;br&gt;3. Seats (id, eventid, seatnumber, status(Available, Locked, Booked))&lt;br&gt;4. Bookings (Id, userId, EventId, status(pending, confirmed, failed)&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="720" x="410" y="-480" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
